#: data/levels/bonus1/snow_bowling.stl:386
msgid ""
"!images/objects/ghost_block/ghost_block.png\n"
"-Ghost Blocks\n"
"Ghost blocks will only allow enemies to enter them. Anything else such as "
"Tux will be prevented from entering."
msgstr ""

#: data/levels/bonus1/snow_bowling.stl:394
msgid ""
"- Be careful!\n"
"In this section you're gonna have to beat the iceblock in a race to the end "
"of the level! Make sure to go fast, as if you lose, you will have to restart "
"the section."
msgstr ""

