#: data/levels/world1/23rd_airborne.stl:3
msgid "23rd Airborne"
msgstr "La 23Âª divisiÃ³n aÃ©rea"

#: data/levels/world1/above_arctic_skies.stl:3
msgid "Above the Antarctic Skies"
msgstr "Arriba de los Cielos Ãrticos"

#: data/levels/world1/above_arctic_skies.stl:339
msgid ""
"-Air Flower\n"
"!images/powerups/airflower/air_flower-0.png\n"
"#The Air Flower lets Tux move much quicker and jump higher. It grants the ability to glide in the air for a few seconds by holding the JUMP Key after a jump."
msgstr "-Flor de Aire\n!images/powerups/airflower/air_flower-0.png\n#La Flor de Aire hace que Tux se mueva mucho mÃ¡s rÃ¡pido y salte mÃ¡s alto. Esta da la habilidad de volar en el aire por unos segundos, presionando la tecla SALTAR luego de un salto."

#: data/levels/world1/antarctic_outpost.stl:3
msgid "Antarctic Outpost"
msgstr "Puesto AntÃ¡rtico"

#: data/levels/world1/between_glaciers.stl:3
msgid "Between Two Glaciers"
msgstr "Entre dos Glaciares"

#: data/levels/world1/bouncy_mountainside.stl:3
msgid "Bouncy, Bouncy Mountainside"
msgstr "Saltarina ladera de montaÃ±a"

#: data/levels/world1/castle_cutscene.stl:3
msgid "Nobody Home"
msgstr "Nadie en casa"

#: data/levels/world1/castle_of_nolok.stl:3
msgid "The Castle of Nolok"
msgstr "El castillo de Nolok"

#: data/levels/world1/crystal_mine.stl:3
msgid "The Crystal Mine"
msgstr "La Mina de Cristal"

#: data/levels/world1/deep_dive_chill.stl:3
msgid "Deep Dive 'n' Chill"
msgstr "InmersiÃ³n profunda"

#: data/levels/world1/end_of_tunnel.stl:3
msgid "End of the Tunnel"
msgstr "Al final del tÃºnel"

#: data/levels/world1/entrance_cave.stl:3
msgid "Entrance to the Cave"
msgstr "Entrada a la cueva"

#: data/levels/world1/fork_in_the_road.stl:3
msgid "A Fork in the Road?"
msgstr "Â¿Una bifurcaciÃ³n en el camino?"

#: data/levels/world1/fork_in_the_road.stl:776
msgid ""
"-Secret Exit\n"
"#Levels can sometimes house a secret exit that will reveal a hidden, alternate path! So keep an eye out for suspicious spots on the worldmap."
msgstr "Salida secreta\n#Los niveles a veces albergan una salida secreta que revelarÃ¡ un camino alternativo oculto. AsÃ­ que estate atento a los puntos sospechosos en el mapa del mundo."

#: data/levels/world1/frosted_fields.stl:3
msgid "The Frosted Fields"
msgstr "Los campos congelantes"

#: data/levels/world1/ice_in_the_hole.stl:3
msgid "Ice in the Hole"
msgstr "Â¡A cubierto, heladeros!"

#: data/levels/world1/info:2 data/levels/world1/worldmap.stwm:3
msgid "Icy Island"
msgstr "Heladisla"

#: data/levels/world1/info:3
msgid "Where your adventure begins."
msgstr "Donde comienza tu aventura."

#: data/levels/world1/into_stars.stl:3
msgid "Into the Stars"
msgstr "Hacia las estrellas"

#: data/levels/world1/intro.stl:3
msgid "Picnic With Penny"
msgstr "De pÃ­cnic con Penny"

#: data/levels/world1/journey_begins.stl:3
msgid "The Journey Begins"
msgstr "Comienza la aventura"

#: data/levels/world1/living_inside_fridge.stl:3
msgid "Living In A Fridge"
msgstr "Mi refrigerada frigovida"

#: data/levels/world1/more_snowballs.stl:3
msgid "Oh No! More Snowballs!"
msgstr "Â¡Vaya! Â¡MÃ¡s bolas de nieve!"

#: data/levels/world1/more_snowballs.stl:319
msgid ""
"-Carrying Objects\n"
"#Tux can pick up objects by holding the ACTION key. Release the ACTION key while standing still to drop the object.\n"
"#If you let go of the ACTION key while Tux is moving, he will throw it!"
msgstr "-Llevar objetos#Tux puede recoger objetos manteniendo pulsada la tecla ACCIÃ“N. SuÃ©ltala mientras estÃ¡s quieto para soltar el objeto.#Si sueltas la tecla ACCIÃ“N mientras Tux se mueve, Â¡lo lanzarÃ¡!"

#: data/levels/world1/more_snowballs.stl:328
msgid ""
"-Up-Throwing\n"
"#Tux can throw most objects upwards, by holding the UP key whilst releasing the ACTION key.\n"
"#When running, Tux throws the object in an arch!"
msgstr "-Lanzamiento hacia arriba#Tux puede lanzar la mayorÃ­a de los objetos hacia arriba manteniendo presionada la tecla ARRIBA mientras suelta la tecla ACCIÃ“N.#Al correr, Â¡Tux lanza el objeto formando un arco!"

#: data/levels/world1/night_chill.stl:3
msgid "Night Chill"
msgstr "Una noche la mar de fresca"

#: data/levels/world1/or_just_me.stl:3
msgid "...Or Is It Just Me?"
msgstr "... Â¿o es mi imaginaciÃ³n?"

#: data/levels/world1/path_in_clouds.stl:3
msgid "A Path in the Clouds"
msgstr "El sendero entre las nubes"

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:2
msgid "At last, Tux managed to rush towards the final room of the icy castle."
msgstr "Por fin, Tux logrÃ³ correr hacia la Ãºltima habitaciÃ³n del castillo helado."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:3
msgid ""
"To his suprise, there was no one here. Neither Penny, nor this... strange "
"Nolok guy."
msgstr "Para su sorpresa, no habÃ­a nadie. Ni Penny ni ese... extraÃ±o Nolok."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:4
msgid "Surely they had to be here somewhere, right? Perhaps a hidden room?"
msgstr "Seguramente tenÃ­an que estar por aquÃ­, Â¿verdad? Â¿QuizÃ¡s en una habitaciÃ³n oculta?"

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:5
msgid ""
"After a bit of back and forth with himself, Tux noticed a small note "
"attached to one of the pillars."
msgstr "DespuÃ©s de un rato de ida y vuelta consigo mismo, Tux notÃ³ una pequeÃ±a nota pegada a uno de los pilares."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:6
msgid "It was yet another note, by that Nolok."
msgstr "Era otra nota mÃ¡s, de ese Nolok."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:7
msgid ""
"It read that he had already left Icy Island towards the far north. If he "
"wished to follow him and save his beloved friend, he would have to come to "
"the Crystal Mine."
msgstr "DecÃ­a que ya habÃ­a salido de la Heladisla rumbo al extremo norte. Si querÃ­a seguirlo y salvar a su querida amiga, tendrÃ­a que ir a la Mina de Cristal."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:8
msgid ""
"Marked below was a rough map of the Glacier Isle, showing a boat and some "
"kind of small pier on the other end."
msgstr "Debajo se veÃ­a un mapa aproximado de la Isla Glaciar, que mostraba un barco y una especie de pequeÃ±o muelle en el otro extremo."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:9
msgid ""
"But before Tux could even make sense of any of it, a load roar filled the "
"room!"
msgstr "Â¡Pero antes de que Tux pudiera siquiera entender algo, un gran rugido llenÃ³ la habitaciÃ³n!"

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:10
msgid ""
"The mighty Yeti had made his appearence, busting his chest in an "
"intimidating fashion!"
msgstr "Â¡El poderoso Yeti hizo su apariciÃ³n, rompiÃ©ndose el pecho de una manera intimidante!"

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:11
msgid ""
"Tux made his way towards a balcony on the other end of the room. With no "
"other option, he jumped!"
msgstr "Tux se dirigiÃ³ a un balcÃ³n al otro lado de la habitaciÃ³n. Sin otra opciÃ³n, Â¡saltÃ³!"

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_castle_cutscene.txt:12
msgid "Unfortunately, the Yeti would not let him go so easily..."
msgstr "Desafortunadamente, el yeti no lo dejarÃ­a ir tan fÃ¡cilmente..."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_crystal_mine.txt:2
msgid ""
"After a long swim across the antarctic waters, Tux arrived at the Glacier "
"Isle mentioned in Nolok's note."
msgstr "DespuÃ©s de un largo nado a travÃ©s de las aguas antÃ¡rticas, Tux llegÃ³ a la Isla Glaciar mencionada en la nota de Nolok."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_crystal_mine.txt:3
msgid ""
"A massive shaft lay before him, leading down into the aforementioned Crystal"
" Mine."
msgstr "Ante Ã©l se extendÃ­a un enorme pozo que conducÃ­a a la antes mencionada Mina de Cristal."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_crystal_mine.txt:4
msgid ""
"Still carrying a spark of doubt that this was not a trap, Tux slowly "
"descended into the depths once more..."
msgstr "AÃºn con una chispa de duda de que esto no fuera una trampa, Tux descendiÃ³ lentamente a las profundidades una vez mÃ¡s..."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_crystal_mine.txt:5
msgid ""
"At last, Tux made it through the crystal mine and found himself on the "
"opposite end of the Glacier Isle."
msgstr "Finalmente, Tux logrÃ³ atravesar la mina de cristal y se encontrÃ³ en el extremo opuesto de la Isla Glaciar."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_crystal_mine.txt:6
msgid ""
"As he was about to exit the mine, Tux was internally hoping that all Nolok "
"wrote in the note was true."
msgstr "Cuando estaba a punto de salir de la mina, Tux esperaba internamente que todo lo que Nolok habÃ­a escrito en la nota fuera cierto."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_crystal_mine.txt:7
msgid ""
"To his relief, he did find a boat still docked. With it, he could sail up "
"north, to find Nolok and save Penny."
