msgstr "\"Tux, secuestrÃ© a tu querida Penny y la llevÃ© a mi castillo.\""

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_intro.txt:7
msgid "\"The path to my fortress is littered with my minions.\""
msgstr "\"El camino hacia mi castillo estÃ¡ infestado con mis ayudantes.\""

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_intro.txt:8
msgid "\"You don't have a chance of saving her! Signed, Nolok.\""
msgstr "\"Â¡No tenÃ©s chance de salvarla! Sinceramente, Nolok\""

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_intro.txt:9
msgid ""
"Realizing the trouble Penny could be in, Tux became determined to save her."
msgstr "DÃ¡ndose cuenta reciÃ©n del quilombo que se armÃ³, Tux tenÃ­a que ir a salvar a Penny."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_intro.txt:10
msgid ""
"Then, Tux saw Nolok's castle in the distance and set off to rescue Penny!"
msgstr "Luego, Tux vio el castillo de Nolok a lo lejos, Â¡y partiÃ³ a rescatar a Penny!"

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yeti_cutscene.txt:2
msgid ""
"After an entire day of navigating Icy Island, Tux had now almost reached the"
" supposed castle of Nolok."
msgstr "DespuÃ©s de un dÃ­a enterito de navegar por la Isla Helada, a Tux ya le falta poco para llegar al castillo de ese tal Nolok."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yeti_cutscene.txt:3
msgid ""
"The lack of sleep during the night may not have been ideal but he was "
"determined to keep going!"
msgstr "Capaz que, trasnochar no era la mejor idea, Â¡pero estaba dispuesto a seguir!"

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yeti_cutscene.txt:4
msgid ""
"Not wanting to waste any more time, Tux continued on, sliding down the hill "
"he was on into the icy valley up ahead."
msgstr "Sin querer perder mÃ¡s el tiempo, Tux siguiÃ³, deslizÃ¡ndose cuesta abajo por la colina hacia el valle helado que tenÃ­a al frente."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yeti_cutscene.txt:5
msgid ""
"Unbeknownst to him, a Yeti seemed very keen on his presence as he kept a "
"close eye on Tux as he continued his journey."
msgstr "Sin darse cuenta de que, un Yeti parecÃ­a estar siguiÃ©ndolo a Tux mientras continuaba con su aventura."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yeti_cutscene.txt:6
msgid ""
"The yeti let out a loud roar and proceeded to follow the little penguin."
msgstr "El Yeti rugiÃ³ fuerte y procediÃ³ a seguir al pingÃ¼ino."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yetiwin_cutscene.txt:2
msgid "He did it! He actually did it! Tux had beaten the mighty yeti!"
msgstr "Â¡Lo logrÃ³! Â¡Posta lo logrÃ³! Â¡Tux le ganÃ³ al poderoso Yeti!"

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yetiwin_cutscene.txt:3
msgid ""
"While it did not take long for the yeti to get up again, to Tux's relief, he"
" did not throw hands again."
msgstr "Aunque el Yeti no tardÃ³ en levantarse, por suerte, no quiso pelear devuelta."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yetiwin_cutscene.txt:4
msgid ""
"The yeti was furious however! He could not understand how a tiny penguin "
"like Tux could have beaten him in a fight."
msgstr "Â¡Pero el Yeti estaba re caliente! No podÃ­a entender cÃ³mo un pingÃ¼inito le pudo ganar en una pelea."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yetiwin_cutscene.txt:5
msgid ""
"Almost as if he forgot Tux was there to begin with, the yeti rushed off, "
"grumbling to himself."
msgstr "DÃ¡ndose cuenta de que lo acaban de dejar pillo, el Yeti se fue, renegÃ¡ndose a sÃ­ mismo."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yetiwin_cutscene.txt:6
msgid "Not sure what to make of it, Tux decided to continue moving onwards."
msgstr "Sin querer prestarle mÃ¡s atenciÃ³n, Tux se fue tambiÃ©n a continuar con su recorrido."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yetiwin_cutscene.txt:7
msgid ""
"As he reached the shore, Tux could already see the Glacier Isle on the "
"horizon."
msgstr "Al llegar a la costa, Tux ya pudo ver desde cada vez mÃ¡s cerca la Isla Glaciar."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yetiwin_cutscene.txt:8
msgid ""
"If he knew Nolok went over there sooner, he could have been there much "
"faster."
msgstr "Si hubiera sabido que Nolok estarÃ­a ahÃ­, Tux hubiera llegado mucho mÃ¡s pronto que Ã©l."

#: data/levels/world1/scripts_yetiwin_cutscene.txt:9
msgid "Perhaps that was Nolok's goal with the note he left behind..."
msgstr "Capaz que, esa fue la intenciÃ³n de Nolok con la nota que dejÃ³ atrÃ¡s."

#: data/levels/world1/shattered_bridge.stl:3
msgid "Shattered Bridge"
msgstr "Puente destruido"

#: data/levels/world1/slippery_slide.stl:3
msgid "Slippery Slide"
msgstr "SÃ³lo un desliz-ante"

#: data/levels/world1/somewhat_smaller_bath.stl:3
msgid "The Somewhat Smaller Bath"
msgstr "Un baÃ±o mÃ¡s que chiquito"

#: data/levels/world1/somewhat_smaller_bath.stl:422
msgid ""
"-Swimming\n"
"!images/creatures/tux/big/swim-1.png\n"
"#When submerged in water, use the DIRECTIONAL keys to swim around freely. Hold the JUMP key to swim even faster."
msgstr "-NataciÃ³n \n!images/creatures/tux/big/swim-1.png \n#Al sumergirte en el agua, usÃ¡ las teclas DIRECCIONALES para nadar libremente. MantenÃ© la tecla de SALTAR apretada para nadar mÃ¡s rÃ¡pido."

#: data/levels/world1/stone_cold.stl:3
msgid "Stone Cold"
msgstr "Pasos congelados"

#: data/levels/world1/stone_cold.stl:200
msgid ""
"-Carrying Objects\n"
"#Tux can pick up objects by holding the ACTION key. Release the ACTION key to drop the object.\n"
"#If you let go of the ACTION key while Tux is moving, he will throw it!"
msgstr "-Llevar Objetos \n#Tux puede agarrar objetos manteniendo pulsada la tecla de ACCIÃ“N. SoltÃ¡ la tecla mientras estÃ¡s quieto para soltar el objeto. \n#Si soltÃ¡s la tecla ACCIÃ“N mientras Tux se mueve, Â¡lo tirarÃ¡!"

#: data/levels/world1/stone_cold.stl:209
msgid ""
"-Up-Throwing\n"
"#Tux can throw most objects upwards by holding the UP key, whilst releasing the ACTION key.\n"
"#When running, Tux throws the object in an arch!"
msgstr "-Lanzar Arriba \n#Tux puede lanzar la mayorÃ­a de los objetos hacia arriba. MantenÃ© presionada la tecla ARRIBA mientras soltÃ¡s la tecla de ACCIÃ“N. \n#Al correr, Â¡Tux tira el objeto en forma de arco!"

#: data/levels/world1/stone_cold.stl:269 data/levels/world1/worldmap.stwm:247
msgid "You found a secret area!"
msgstr "Â¡Encontraste un Ã¡rea secreta!"

#: data/levels/world1/under_the_ice.stl:3
msgid "Under the Ice"
msgstr "Debajo del hielo"

#: data/levels/world1/welcome_antarctica.stl:3
msgid "Welcome to Antarctica"
msgstr "Â¡Bienvenido a la AntÃ¡rtida!"

#: data/levels/world1/welcome_antarctica.stl:117
msgid ""
"-Eggs\n"
"!images/powerups/egg/egg-shade.png\n"
"#The egg makes Tux grow larger. Tux can then smash wooden blocks with his head."
msgstr "-Huevos\n!images/powerups/egg/egg-shade.png\n#El huevo hace que Tux crezca. Y despuÃ©s, Tux podrÃ¡ romper bloques de madera con la cabeza."

#: data/levels/world1/welcome_antarctica.stl:126
msgid ""
"-Fire Flower\n"
"!images/powerups/fireflower/fire_flower-0.png\n"
"#The fire flower gives Tux the ability to shoot fireballs."
msgstr "-Flor de Fuego\n!images/powerups/fireflower/fire_flower-0.png\n#La Flor de Fuego le otorga a Tux la habilidad de disparar bolas de fuego."

#: data/levels/world1/welcome_antarctica.stl:135
msgid ""
"-Tux Doll\n"
"!images/powerups/1up/1up.png\n"
"#Tux Dolls are a rare collectible which are needed to unlock the Bonus Islands!\n"
"\n"
"#Collect all of them to unlock fun, additional levels!"
msgstr "-MuÃ±eco Tux \n!images/powerups/1up/1up.png# \n#Â¡Los MuÃ±ecos Tux son un coleccionable raro que necesitÃ¡s para desbloquear islas extra! \n \n#Â¡ColeccionÃ¡los todos para desbloquear niveles adicionales divertidos!"

#: data/levels/world1/yeti_boss.stl:3
msgid "No More Mr. Ice Guy"
msgstr "Basta, Sr. de hielo"

#: data/levels/world1/yeti_cutscene.stl:3
msgid "An Unsuspected Follower"
msgstr "Un seguidor insospechado"

