¨Ì±gFª]␀öo‘ ¡Ã*ûB†ì9Ñs«w␀␀*bó^ö™␀Æ€wKšï´e“çÃJXŠ‹æE—5␀¶üçYxñğ…š"␀␀␀␀’ ␀␀␀␀XfúÑ„%0# Copyright (c) 2022 A. Semphris <semphris@protonmail.com>
